    "Class Features": {
      "checkboxes": {},
      "fields": {},
      "sectionBody": "<div><strong>Sneak Attack</strong><br>When you have advantage on a Melee Strike or Weapon Throw, add 3 Extra Dice to the roll. None of the weapons used for the attack may have the Heavy, Reach, or Two-Handed properties.</div><div><br></div><div><strong>Basic Dual Wielding</strong><br>You may wield two one-handed weapons, provided no more than one has the Heavy property. When you perform a Melee Strike using both weapons, make one attack roll and apply the following:<ul><li>Add the Extra Dice from both weapons to the roll.</li><li>Use the higher of the two weapons' Minimum Roll values.</li><li>Choose one damage type available to either weapon.</li><li>If you roll a double six, choose and apply the Double 6 effect of one weapon.</li></ul></div>",
      "splitFields": {},
      "dynamicRows": []
